   "body": "Results (win2, posted by the coordinator from win2's comms entry of 2026-11-07 20:46 UTC; win2's gh write was blocked by its permission classifier).\n\nAll four nodes done, `amp_flint_par.py <wf> 33 1000 960 --procs 4 --fit phys --mf 6:12`:\n\n| \u03c9/\u03c9\u221e | wall | last-order sigma_err |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1.06 | 118 min | 5.15e-26 |\n| 1.09 | 119 min | 1.21e-26 |\n| 1.11 | 114 min | 1.44e-26 (rerun from k 1 after a worker crash at k 21) |\n| 1.14 | 119 min | 1.88e-26 |\n\nEvery node plateaus (sigma_err falls over the last five orders). Raw: `T155-win2/` at b6dc8f6; raw_check.py passes. No control in this task; the analysis is a separate task.",
